      "action": "send_reply(id=\"3u2CxU6QQ8LhObQTQf8jn0\", body=\"Hi Jim,\n\nThank you for your email! I confirm that we have received your quote request for the Supply Chain Optimization Project.\n\nI've logged this in our system and our team will begin preparing a formal quote for the following scope:\n- Inventory management system integration\n- Demand forecasting module\n- Supplier portal development\n\nBased on the budget of $85,000 and timeline for Q2 2026, we'll work on putting together a comprehensive proposal for you.\n\nI'll be in touch soon with the formal quote. If you have any additional details or requirements in the meantime, please don't hesitate to let me know.\n\nBest regards,\nLisa Chen\")",
