      "metadata": {
        "message": "\n\nPerfect! I've completed all four tasks successfully. Here's a summary:\n\n## 1. Email Found and Read\nFound the email from Jim Halpert (jhalpert@globex.com) with subject **\"Quote Request - Supply Chain Optimization Project\"**\n\n## 2. Contact and Account Records Located\n- **Jim Halpert Contact**: ID `4a1a1a18-c80f-11f1-ab99-6e6e7c1098ab`\n  - Phone: 555-0102 (work), 555-0103 (mobile)\n  - Email: jhalpert@globex.com\n\n- **Globex Industries Account**: ID `4a1a17d0-c80f-11f1-ab99-6e6e7c1098ab`\n  - Industry: Manufacturing\n  - Location: Gotham, USA\n\n## 3. Opportunity Created\nCreated new opportunity with details:\n- **Opportunity ID**: `55f276a0-96f2-5edb-3b60-6acfe8135241`\n- **Name**: Supply Chain Optimization Project - Globex Industries\n- **Amount**: $85,000\n- **Sales Stage**: Prospecting\n- **Date Closed**: 2026-06-30 (Q2 2026)\n- **Description**: Includes all project scope items (Inventory management system integration, Demand forecasting module, Supplier portal development)\n- **Linked Account**: Globex Industries\n\n## 4. Reply Sent\nSuccessfully replied to Jim's email confirming receipt of the quote request and assuring him that the team will prepare a formal quote based on the $85,000 budget and Q2 2026 timeline.\n\nThe opportunity is now in the CRM system and ready for the sales team to work on!"
